    "featured_cards_cDPnrU": {
      "type": "featured-cards",
      "blocks": {
        "card_Pzzgdn": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LawnMaster_Robot_Mower_OcuMow_18_Boundary_Wire.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Boundary Wire Free",
            "text": "<p>OcuMow® 18 detects your lawn and edges for you, so you don’t have to train your robot where to go or laboriously map out your boundaries in an app. In certain situations, you may need to make your lawn borders more clearly defined. </p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "card_RmqkLB": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LawnMaster_Robot_Mower_OcuMow_18_Schedule.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Customisable Cutting Schedules",
            "text": "<p>In Schedule mode, using a simple dial and LCD screen interface, you can customise when and for how long you want your robot to be active. OcuMow® 18 can be scheduled to mow on any day, from dawn until dusk.</p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "card_jVYm6A": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LawnMaster_Robot_Mower_OcuMow_18_Drop_and_Mow.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Drop & Mow Mode",
            "text": "<p>Developed with a detachable LawnMaster MX 24V lithium battery, OcuMow® 18 can also be used in drop-and-mow mode for cutting other lawns, in other locations. Simply take the fully charged mower to the other lawn and choose the spiral or random cutting pattern. OcuMow® 18 will mow until the battery is low and wait on the lawn to be taken back to its charging station.</p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "card_Pzzgdn",
        "card_RmqkLB",
        "card_jVYm6A"
      ],
