    "featured_cards_UpGWmA": {
      "type": "featured-cards",
      "blocks": {
        "card_hf7cGE": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LawnMaster_Robot_Mower_OcuMow_18_No_Go.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "'No Go' Areas",
            "text": "<p>No-Go strip can temporarily or permanently cordon off sections of your garden that you do not want OcuMow® 18 to go, such as recently re-seeded patches of grass, steep slopes, ponds or rewilded areas of your garden. The mower detects the strip using on-board sensors and navigates away. 10m of No-Go strip is included in the box. </p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "card_xDTzRV": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LawnMaster_Robot_Mower_OcuMow_18_OGR.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Optical Grass Recognition",
            "text": "<p>For OcuMow® 18 to perform at its best, your garden should have a clearly defined border around the perimeter of your lawn, such as dark mulch, paving or gravel, or a raised edge at least 6cm high. As with other robot mowers, a grass trimmer (not included) is needed to trim the lawn edges.</p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "card_GdrDRW": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LawnMaster_Robot_Mower_OcuMow_18_Safety.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Safety and Security",
            "text": "<p>For safety, lift, tilt & bump sensors stop the blades immediately if the mower is picked up or bumps into objects, and a PIN code prevents unauthorised use. Operating only during daylight hours, OcuMow® 18 helps protect nocturnal wildlife, such as hedgehogs, allowing them to roam safely at night.</p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "card_hf7cGE",
        "card_xDTzRV",
        "card_GdrDRW"
      ],
