            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>OcuMow® 18 has a sophisticated algorithm that cuts your lawn in a randomised pattern. This ensures your whole lawn is cut gradually and evenly, nurturing a healthier lawn over time.<br/></p>",
