        "entry_i6RizN": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "How does the No-Go Strip work?",
            "text": "<p>The OcuMow® 18 robot mower is supplied with 10m of No-Go strip. This strip, which can be cut into sections and buried under the lawn's surface, can be positioned around your garden to temporarily or permanently cordon off sections of your garden that you do not want OcuMow® 18 to go, such as recently re-seeded patches of grass, steep slopes, ponds or rewilded areas of your garden. The mower detects the strip using on-board sensors and navigates away.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
            "product_specifications": "",
            "html": "",
            "collection": "",
            "collection_products_per_page": 8,
            "products": [],
