        },
        "entry_XmrYXg": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "Can this mower be used in a garden with a pond?",
            "text": "<p>It is possible to use OcuMow® 18 on lawns with a pond, however it is strongly recommended that the pond is surrounded by a raised barrier to safeguard against the mower falling in. Pond vegetation could be mistaken for grass by the mower. We recommend either a raised edge or a paved/gravel border at least 75cm wide surrounding the pond. No Go magnetic strip can also be used at least 70cm away from the pond edge for additional security. Water damaged mowers are not covered under guarantee.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
